  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Books and Education for Children in Rural Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Picaflor House Community Outreach Programme improves access to and quality of education for children in rural villages around Cusco. Online learning has excluded many rural children from education, due to lack of access to the internet and computing devices. Our Mobile Library takes books, teachers and other learning resources to help 200 children re-engage with education and catch-up academically.</narrative>
  </description>
